config NETSTACK3_RUST_LIFECYCLE
	bool "Experimental Rust Internet socket lifetime slice"
	depends on NET && !INET && RUST
	depends on !NETSTACK3
	help
	  KVM-only feasibility experiment: Rust owns admission, readiness and
	  provider generations and poll waits; C adapts Linux socket/FD callbacks.
	  No TCP/UDP data path. Not a production replacement for NETSTACK3.
